- init_valve2 给出的值：
    Tc=Ts_avg=0.001 s
    Vdc=24 V, R=3 Ohm, L_H=2e-3 H, tau_e=0.667 ms
    a_pl = exp(-1.5) = 0.2231301601
    b_pl = (24/3)*(1-a_pl) = 6.214958719
    fc = 1000/30 = 33.33 Hz, wc = 209.4395 rad/s
